{
 "priority": 7,
 "source_bins": [
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "Lemme guess, red or black lace—": "",
  "I'll bash your brains out with a fire extinguisher if you bring up my underwear again! Would you like that!?": "",
  "...Sorry. That was callous of me.": "",
  "Come on! Don't guys ever think about something normal?": "",
  "You want to know my taste in <font_kind=yakuza_italic>men</font_kind>?": "",
  "...Really?": "",
  "Hmm... I haven't really given that much thought.": "",
  "But... I guess I'd want a man I can rely on.": "",
  "Someone I can feel safe with.": "",
  "Reliable and safe. Got it.": "",
  "Good thing the Twisted Trio were all arrested. Especially that Giant Impact guy... what a monster.": "",
  "Mhm. Thanks to you, I can finally walk around town without looking over my shoulder every ten seconds.": "",
  "Even so, you really are some kind of perv magnet.": "",
  "...That's what my brother keeps saying.": "",
  "And if that really is true... I'm worried something like this might happen again in the future.": "",
  "Don't worry. If I see anyone who so much as gives you a dirty look, I'll send their perverted ass to jail.": "",
  "You will? Wow... I'm glad I met such a dependable guy!": "",
  "As long as you're on my side, then I guess I have nothing to fear, huh?": "",
  "I think your brother was right. There's just something about you that weirdos might find attractive.": "",
  "What makes you say that...?": "",
  "Hmm... Maybe because you're so kind and innocent? I dunno, it's hard to put into words.": "",
  "Seriously...? I totally don't get it...": "",
  "We should take a picture while we're at it.": "",
  "Okay! For memory's sake!": "",
  "Does this look okay?": "",
  "...Though, I am a little embarrassed.": "",
  "I'll send this to you later.": "",
  "Hmm. Not impressed. Maybe we should do this one over?": "",
  "Yagami-san. I just wanted to say thank you for listening to me.": "",
  "Sure. Let me know if you ever need anything.": "",
  "...Anything?": "",
  "Yeah. Anything at all.": "",
  "So... this might be too much to ask, but...": "",
  "Okay. I know this is totally out of the blue, but I actually do need your help.": "",
  "I'd like you to do some practice interviews with me.": "",
  "Huh? You want to practice taking interviews... with me?": "",
  "Yeah. I haven't passed a single interview and I can't put my finger on why.": "",
  "But I feel like you could help me figure out what's wrong.": "",
  "You might be overestimating me. I've never really had to hunt for jobs before.": "",
  "Even so, I'm sure you can give me <font_kind=yakuza_italic>some</font_kind> kind of advice!": "",
  "Will you do it? For me?": "",
  "All right. I can't promise I'll be of much help, though.": "",
  "By the next time you see me, I'll be ready for that interview.": "",
  "Great. Just let me know and we can get started.": "",
  "Sorry. I'm just not sure I'm the right person to ask...": "",
  "That's not true at all!": "",
  "In fact, you've helped me out a number of times now... I'm always impressed by how well you think things through.": "",
  "All I want is to be a little more... like you. Is that too much to ask?": "",
  "(Not sure what she sees in me, but I guess I'll take the compliment.)": "",
  "Talking to you has really eased my mind about this whole job situation.": "",
  "Glad I could help.": "",
  "I admit, I'm a little burned out from all the talking, though.": "",
  "Maybe it's just nerves.": "",
  "(Hmm. Did I make Tsukino-chan feel uneasy somehow?)": "",
  "I notice you haven't fastened all your buttons.": "",
  "But isn't the proper way to leave the last button undone?": "",
  "That's right. I'm impressed you knew.": "",
  "Hehe, even I know that!": "",
  "Actually, that's wrong. You're thinking of how guys do it.": "",
  "The right way...": "",
  "Is to leave them all unfastened.": "",
  "...All of them? Wouldn't that make me look like a slacker?": "",
  "Maybe. But it might make you seem more approachable. Give you that relaxed sort of vibe.": "",
  "So it all depends on who's interviewing me?": "",
  "...Isn't that kind of a bad strategy?": "",
  "Well, maybe. In that case...": "",
  "The proper way for a lady to wear her jacket is to fasten all the buttons.": "",
  "Really? I had no idea!": "",
  "I'm surprised you knew.": "",
  "Yeah, I used to wear a suit for my old job.": "",
  "I remember one time, I pointed out my colleague's button and... yeah. It got kinda awkward.": "",
  "That bag is too flashy for someone wearing a suit. Something black or dark blue would fit better.": "",
  "That's true... I never thought about that.": "",
  "Ahhh... Today was so much fun.": "",
  "I needed this little break. All I ever think about is job hunting these days.": "",
  "It's important to take it easy every now and then.": "",
  "Maybe we should sit down somewhere and talk?": "",
  "We could practice for your interview like you mentioned.": "",
  "O-Okay!": "",
  "I guess I'll start by talking about why I applied. The interview is for a publishing company.": "",
  "I see. Then I'll pretend to be the hiring manager and ask you a couple questions.": "",
  "...Ooh. I'm getting nervous already...": "",
  "Well then. Please go ahead.": "",
  "Uhh... the reason I applied here is...": "",
  "...Go on.": "",
  "I, uh, forgot what I was gonna say.": "",
  "My mind... it went completely blank...": "",
  "Okay, well. Just try and relax, for starters.": "",
  "Mm. All right. I think I'm good now.": "",
  "What in particular makes you interested in our company?": "",
  "...Oh, right! The reason I'm applying! Umm...": "",
  "Well, I've always liked to read.": "",
  "I was the type of girl who would stay inside reading rather than going out to play.": "",
  "Ah. So you were more of an indoors type of person.": "",
  "Yes. I actually didn't have many friends, other than my brother...": "",
  "So I would often fantasize about living in the world of my books...": "",
  "That's why I've always wanted to publish books that inspire the imagination.": "",
  "(Hmm. What would make Tsukino-chan's statement stand out more?)": "",
  "Have you been applying to other companies as well?": "",
  "Y-Yes! I feel like I should have my options open, so...": "",
  "Does that mean we're not the company you want to work for the most?": "",
  "Oh, well... that's...": "",
  "Hey, you really think they'll take it that way?": "",
  "I think so. I might hesitate about hiring you if I knew you were applying for other companies.": "",
  "Also, you should have a strong reason why this company would be your first pick.": "",
  "Ooh, that's good.": "",
  "I... would say so.": "",
  "Unlike my brother, I was pretty timid. I wasn't really good at meeting people or opening up to others.": "",
  "But I'm much better now!": "",
  "I didn't really like how I was, so when I got to college, I made a conscious effort to talk to more people.": "",
  "And was that effort successful?": "",
  "I think so...": "",
  "I made three... No, five! I made five new friends.": "",
  "...I see. I suppose that does count for something.": "",
  "So, how would you describe yourself in a couple sentences?": "",
  "Uh... Let's see...": "",
  "Well, I think I'm pretty diligent... and spunky! Is that the right word...? Hmm. Oh, and I'm also a pretty balanced worker.": "",
  "On top of that, people are always telling me I'm kind. It's true—I almost never get mad!": "",
  "Um... I look forward to working with you?": "",
  "Well, I can tell you'd make a very teachable employee... just not a particularly well-spoken one.": "",
  "Now, can you tell me what kind of contribution you can make to our company?": "",
  "But I'm just a student! What kind of significant contribution could I even make...?": "",
  "Well... I guess I could copy papers and make tea without giving you any attitude.": "",
  "I highly doubt a company would hire someone who doesn't think they can make any real contributions.": "",
  "But... I'm just a student...": "",
  "I'm sure there's at least something you can do. Like taking responsibility for the smaller tasks, for example.": "",
  "I see. I'd better think about every possible angle to take in order to strike a good impression, huh?": "",
  "Hmm. I suggest you learn about the company culture the moment you get hired. That way you can find where you fit in.": "",
  "That's smart.": "",
  "I remember you said you like drawing. Do you also do other kinds of art, like watercolor or oil painting, maybe?": "",
  "Oh, no, I don't do anything complicated like that...": "",
  "I'm mostly about character illustrations. I'm sort of a geek that way...": "",
  "Oh, so you're a manga artist, then?": "",
  "Yeah... except for the fact that I can't come up with any kind of story.": "",
  "I can draw cute characters or creatures, but that's about it.": "",
  "That's still really cool, though. I'd love to check those out.": "",
  "You would?": "",
  "Well, you drew them so, yeah.": "",
  "I'm not so sure they're ready to be shown off, though...": "",
  "Sorry... but maybe once I'm a little more talented... I'll let you take a look.": "",
  "Okay. Guess I have to be patient.": "",
  "...You really don't seem like you're interested.": "",
  "What? Of course I am.": "",
  "I mean, it's fine. I didn't plan on showing you in the first place.": "",
  "So, about that guy you're supposed to marry... What's he all about?": "",
  "Oh... him.": "",
  "I haven't seen him in a long, long time...": "",
  "And I'd rather not remember him, either.": "",
  "(Guess that's a sore subject.)": "",
  "I wonder what your \"future husband\" thinks about this whole situation.": "",
  "Hmm... couldn't say. Haven't seen him in forever.": "",
  "Last time was the first year of middle school.": "",
  "Okay. Well, do you know if he's going along with it? Or are his parents calling all the shots?": "",
  "...Hmm. He seemed to be pretty comfortable with the whole thing. Unlike me.": "",
  "Maybe he's just doing it for his family's sake.": "",
  "Well, if it's you we're talking about... I'm sure he wouldn't mind getting hitched.": "",
  "Huh? Why do you say that?": "",
  "Because, Tsukino-chan, you have a great personality. Not to mention you're pretty darn cute.": "",
  "What...? Y-You really think I'm <font_kind=yakuza_italic>cute</font_kind>?": "",
  "...Hehe. You just love to dish out the compliments, don't you?": "",
  "I can't imagine it's easy on him, either. Not being able to choose who he marries...": "",
  "Yeah. Especially when he's stuck with a downer like me...": "",
  "(Gosh... She really doesn't have much self-esteem...)": "",
  "What was he like in middle school?": "",
  "He wasn't such a bad kid.": "",
  "He was quiet. He liked small animals and plants. He also read a lot.": "",
  "So he was pretty mellow, huh? Sounds like you two might actually get along.": "",
  "I'm not so sure. We might have had common interests...": "",
  "But I have no idea what he's like now.": "",
  "Sounds like he's pretty much the opposite of me.": "",
  "Yeah. You don't strike me as the bookworm type at all...": "",
  "If he's the heir to a wealthy family, does that mean he's some kind of elite member of society?": "",
  "It seems so. I heard he's studying abroad in England right now.": "",
  "Studying in England, huh... Must be nice.": "",
  "Yeah, well. He's getting a good education, but an awful marriage. Being part of the elite isn't all it's cracked up to be.": "",
  "Nah, if anything I think he'd be happy because he gets to marry you. I'm honestly a little jealous.": "",
  "...Why would you say something like that?": "",
  "Yeah. I do kinda feel for the guy.": "",
  "Right. Having to get married to someone like me...": "",
  "You know that's not what I meant.": "",
  "That elegant posterior posture... That bewitching feminine figure! Has a decade spent apart deceived my eyes?": "",
  "Alas, it is as I suspected!": "",
  "Huh? What's up with this dude...": "",
  "At long last... my fair, sweet Tsukino-san! It <font_kind=yakuza_italic>is</font_kind> you!": "",
  "The ten torturous years I spent without you seemed longer than eternity itself.": "",
  "Ah, how I longed to gaze upon your delicate visage once more...": "",
  "I... I'm sorry?": "",
  "I've sailed across oceans, climbed rugged mountains... And after 120 passes of the moon, I stand before you here.": "",
  "Wait... You wouldn't happen to be—": "",
  "Yes, it is I! Daichi Ryuzenji, your beloved fiancé!": "",
  "No... No way!": "",
  "And you... I see these years have treated you quite well.": "",
  "Compared to you... even Venus herself appears haggard.": "",
  "...Who?": "",
  "...And here is where words fail me. Were I to compose a thousand sonnets, they'd not scratch thy splendor's surface!": "",
  "Humanity only realizes the futility of speech... when confronted by absolute beauty!": "",
  "But I digress. Have you not noticed the princely aura of sophistication seeping from within me?": "",
  "For I have metamorphosed into a true English gentleman worthy of your affections and praise!": "",
  "Hey, will you stop monologuing for a second!?": "",
  "Yes, my liege?": "",
  "...What are you even doing here? I thought you were studying in England.": "",
  "Ah, but of course. I have completed my academic pursuits in England and hence returned.": "",
  "I heard you made a journey to Tokyo, so I took it upon myself to find you. And here we are: two lovers reunited!": "",
  "Tsukino-san. Is this guy really him?": "",
  "Yes. Even though he named himself earlier and stated that he was my fiancé... I still find it hard to believe.": "",
  "And you must be Tsukino-san's servant. Well then, your service has been much appreciated. You are hereby dismissed.": "",
  "Oh, I'm no servant.": "",
  "What? Then just who do you think you are?": "",
  "...Hmph. You can't fool me with such nonsense. Tsukino-san would never fall for a mongrel like you.": "",
  "...Her friend, you say? Hmm. Well, I am Tsukino-san's dearly beloved.": "",
  "And for you to traipse about with her unchaperoned is entirely unacceptable! So refrain from this at once!": "",
  "So, I don't mean to knock you off your high horse, but she and I were trying to have a conversation here.": "",
  "...Hmph. Then answer me this!": "",
  "How much is your salary? And what's your net worth? Half a pence and a moldy loaf of bread, I'd wager...": "",
  "And why should I tell you?": "",
  "Yes, Young Master?": "",
  "Yukikawa. My bank account in Switzerland. Astound this peasant with its contents, if you would be so kind.": "",
  "Ah, certainly. When converted into Japanese yen, you possess... roughly two hundred million, sir.": "",
  "T-Two hundred <font_kind=yakuza_italic>million</font_kind> yen?": "",
  "Ahahahaha. Did you hear that?": "",
  "That paltry sum is merely what I've been putting away for our wedding. \"Tsukino savings,\" if you will.": "",
  "Well then! It appears that I surpass you in... hmm, let's see: status, money, <font_kind=yakuza_italic>and</font_kind> appearance! Oh, you <font_kind=yakuza_italic>poor fool</font_kind>...!": "",
  "(This guy...)": "",
  "Now, Tsukino-san. Let us return to our province where we will have a wedding of incomparable grandeur.": "",
  "Where do you wish to travel for our honeymoon? France? Perhaps Italy?": "",
  "H-Hold on a second!": "",
  "Hm? Onto what?": "",
  "Look... I haven't fully thought this marriage through yet. I mean, I haven't even graduated college...": "",
  "How... How strange. You promised me when we were children.": "",
  "I remember it like it was yesterday. We were at the sandbox in the playground...": "",
  "And you came up and told me, \"Let's get married when we grow up.\"": "",
  "The joy those words brought me... Not a day went by when I forgot about our sacred oath.": "",
  "Well, yeah, I did say that... but...": "",
  "Hm hmm hmmm. Ah, I see how it is.": "",
  "You're trying not to hurt the feelings of this peasant here. Such kindness... You truly are a goddess of a woman.": "",
  "Actually, we were trying to have some tea together...": "",
  "So now's not a good time for all this.": "",
  "Oh. Well. How rude of me. A true English gentleman would never interrupt tea time.": "",
  "It seems my timing was off. Very well, then. I shall return.": "",
  "Ah, but before I go. Allow me to say one thing, you impoverished-looking peasant.": "",
  "What do you want?": "",
  "Make no mistake... I am Tsukino-san's one and only fiancé, and don't you forget it.": "",
  "Now then... Let us be off, Yukikawa.": "",
  "As you wish, Young Master.": "",
  "Sorry you had to go through all that. I know he's a little... different than most guys.": "",
  "He kept saying he was an English gentleman. Is he part British, too?": "",
  "No, I'm pretty sure he's full Japanese. In fact, he's from the countryside, somewhere out in Ibaraki.": "",
  "I think he gets all caught up in that persona of his because he studied overseas...": "",
  "So he's a makeshift English gentleman, then.": "",
  "Geez, and right when we were finished with the Twisted Trio, too...": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "...Really?": "...จริงเหรอคะ?",
  "Glad I could help.": "ดีใจที่ช่วยได้นะ",
  "O-Okay!": "โ-โอเคค่ะ!",
  "...Go on.": "...ว่ามาสิ",
  "I think so...": "คงไหวนะ...",
  "You would?": "รู้ดีเหรอ?",
  "I... I'm sorry?": "ผม... ขอโทษนะครับ?",
  "No... No way!": "ไม่... ไม่มีทางครับ!",
  "...Who?": "...ใครเหรอ?",
  "(This guy...)": "(ไอ้หมอนี่...)",
  "What do you want?": "แกต้องการอะไร?"
 }
}
